    "description": "Vintage Persian-Inspired Design: A striking central medallion sits among layered geometric borders in warm rust, deep blue, and neutral accents, bringing classic American-boho character to your living room, bedroom, or seating nook. Plush Imitation Cashmere Surface: Crafted from soft faux-cashmere fibers that feel cozy underfoot while resisting everyday flattening, making this 160 x 230cm rug a comfortable foundation for sofas, beds, and reading corners. Secure Silicone Non-Slip Backing: The underside features a grippy silicone texture that helps the rug stay put on hardwood, tile, and laminate floors, reducing slips and shifts in busy households. Slim 0.5cm Low-Profile Build: At just half a centimeter thick, the rug lies flat under furniture and doorways, minimizing trip hazards while still delivering a cushioned, welcoming feel. Versatile & Easy to Maintain: Sized at 160 x 230cm, it works beautifully as a living-room centerpiece, bedroom bedside rug, or sofa accent; simply vacuum regularly and spot-clean to keep the pattern looking fresh.",
