    "description": "COMPLETE 4 PIECE BEDDING SET: This coordinated set arrives with one quilt cover measuring 170 x 220cm, one fitted sheet measuring 100 x 190cm, and two pillowcases measuring 50 x 75cm, so a twin bed can be dressed in one simple step with pieces that are cut to match each other in both pattern and scale. PATCHWORK BLOCK PRINT DESIGN: A grid of tile inspired motifs in warm brown, olive and taupe tones gives the bed a relaxed vintage character that reads calm rather than busy, blending easily with rustic, farmhouse, boho and traditional bedroom styles, and pairing well with natural wood furniture and woven textures. SOFT BREATHABLE FABRIC: The smooth woven surface feels gentle against the skin and lets air move through the bedding, helping you stay comfortable across warm nights and cooler seasons, while the lightweight drape layers neatly under a blanket or duvet without feeling bulky or heavy. SNUG FITTED SHEET: An all around elastic edge holds the fitted sheet smoothly across the mattress and helps it stay in place as you shift during the night, while the quilt cover and matching pillowcases complete a tidy, coordinated look that is easy to straighten each morning. EASY CARE AND EVERYDAY VALUE: Machine wash the set in cold water on a gentle cycle and tumble dry on low for fuss free upkeep, and the printed colors stay rich wash after wash, making this set a practical pick for a primary bedroom, guest room, dorm room or a thoughtful housewarming gift.",
